 before2026-08-01; preexisting artifacts unchanged. Negative results retained; no costs/profitability/deployment claim.","purpose":"Test new futures volume intensity and aggressor flow for conditional up/down direction, holding flat probability fixed; flow must improve BOTH spot and volume controls.","references":["https://github.com/binance/binance-public-data","https://developers.binance.info/en/docs/catalog/core-trading-derivatives-trading-usd-s-m-futures/api/rest-api/market-data"],"representation":"Volume/trade activity=log(latest/mean(previous120minutes)), clipped+-4; volume denominator floor1e-12, trade floor1, ratio floor1e-6. Activity interacted with signed spot features. Flowh=(2*sum(buy)-sum(volume))/sum(volume), zero if no volume, h=1/5/30/120. Latest included in flow, excluded from activity reference. Cross-asset average excludes own. All12 additions odd under simultaneous price and aggressor reflection. No futures price features.","source":"Binance USD-M monthly trade klines1m, Oct(previous year)-Jul(evaluation year), BTC/ETH/SOL, 90 ZIPs. Millisecond time, base volume, taker-buy base volume, trade count retained after OHLC validation. Aggressive sell=volume-buy, not short positions or order book. Official SHA256 checksums, 8MB ZIP/32MB expanded per file maximum, two download workers.","status":"Retrospective exploration on already explored spot outcomes, Jan-Jul2024/2025/2026; new futures trading-volume source. Not prospective or pristine validation.","target":"Five-minute spot return from anchor+1min to anchor+6min. Binary fit on matured non-flat outcomes; recombine with identical frozen cross-model flat probabilities for ALL-anchor original direction gate.","training":"Monthly90day rolling pooled3asset logistic, C=.1 max500 tol1e-8, reflected augmentation, train-only normalization and+-8 clip. Spot23, volume27, flow35 features;63fits, no asset identifier. No parameter/signal sweep after scores.","uncertainty":"4000 paired7day moving-block replicates,